rest 2
clank: "Wait one beat... I found tape" = 0/2 2 4/.5 5/.5 4 2/3 | II 4, V 4 ; do nod ; react laugh

[act 4, choir]
# Act IV — Studio 404 Lit Up (All 4 acts braided together simultaneously + Tracking & Hertz booth heckle)
vee: "One tube wakes up... both tubes agree" = 0 2 4 5 7 5 4 2 | I 4, V 4 ; do nod
  + tabby: "High ring climbs in harmony" = 9 7 5 7 5 4 2/2
  + chip @2: "Wings lift high and shine" = 7 9 8 7 9/2
  + pip @4: "Plugged and bright" = 4 5 7/2
vee: "Learn the song and twist the band" = lift ; do cheer
  + tabby: "Trace by trace we hold the hand" = 7 8 9 7 5 4 2/2
  + gruff @2: "Walk the bass below" = 0 2 4 5 7/2
